+# Tasks: Command-Line Bookmark Manager
+
+**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-bookmark-cli-manager/`
+
+**Prerequisites**: [plan.md](./plan.md), [spec.md](./spec.md), [research.md](./research.md), [data-model.md](./data-model.md), [contracts/cli.md](./contracts/cli.md), [contracts/output-formats.md](./contracts/output-formats.md)
+
+**Tests**: Test tasks ARE included and are NOT optional for this feature. Constitution Principle III ("Every Requirement Is Testable") requires every functional requirement to map to at least one `pytest` test that names it, and SC-004 requires the same for all 23 FRs including every error path. Tests for a story are written before that story's implementation and must fail first.
+
+**Organization**: Tasks are grouped by user story so each story can be implemented, tested and delivered independently.
+
+## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`
+
+- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)
+- **[Story]**: Which user story this task belongs to (US1, US2, US3, US4)
+- Include exact file paths in descriptions
+
+## Path Conventions
+
+Single project, as fixed by [plan.md](./plan.md#project-structure): runtime code in `src/bookmarks/`, tests in `tests/`, `pyproject.toml` at the repository root. No `models/`, `services/` or `lib/` subdivision (Principle IV).
+
