+- [ ] T017 [P] [US1] Implement `validate_url(url)` in `src/bookmarks/cli.py`: the literal, case-sensitive test `url.startswith(("http://", "https://"))` with no parsing and no network access; on failure write a diagnostic naming the rejected URL and both expected prefixes to stderr and yield status 2 (FR-009). Called before any connection is opened so a rejected `add` cannot create the store (research.md D4)
