+## Notes
+
+- [P] tasks = different files or independent functions, no dependencies on incomplete tasks
+- Tests are mandatory here, not optional: Principle III and SC-004 require a named covering test for each of FR-001…FR-023, error paths included
+- Exit statuses are contractual: 0 success, 1 usage error / unopenable store / bad export format, 2 rejected URL prefix, 3 absent id on delete. Statuses 2 and 3 carry no other meaning (research.md D5)
+- Validation always precedes opening the store, so a rejected command never creates or alters the store file (research.md D4, FR-006, SC-007)
+- Tags are normalised on write (trimmed, de-duplicated, sorted, comma-joined), so the stored value is the displayed value in TSV, CSV and JSON
+- Commit after each task or logical group; stop at any checkpoint to validate a story independently